        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Attractive sale of a charming 3 bedroom traditional style country cottage situated in an unspoilt rural area. Located ina desirable and convenient location approximately10 km from Nenagh town and c5 km from access onto the main Limerick to Dublin motorway.\r\nThe accommodation comprises of kitchen, sitting room, 3 bedrooms (two traditional attic bedrooms), entrance porch, bathroom and detached fuel and storage sheds.\r\nThe residence measures circa 50 m,tr sq on the ground floor. \r\nThe property  is in need of some modernisation and redecoration but will lend itself suitable for both investors or would make a delightful principal private residence. Externally the property benefits from a rear garden which would provide many hours of enjoyment for any keen garden enthusiast."
      },
